* #presence "Bruxism presence" "Whether bruxism is present."
* #circadian-type "Bruxism circadian type" "Whether bruxism occurs during sleep, wakefulness, or both."
* #diagnostic-grade "Bruxism diagnostic grade" "The possible, probable, or definite diagnostic grade."
